  "prefLabel": "Fors 403.03 Continuing Education Unit Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 403.03 Continuing Education Unit Requirements. Continuing education units shall meet the following criteria or no credit shall be awarded:\n\n(a) Continuing education activities shall be relevant to the practice of forestry. Such continuing education activities may include technical, ethical, or managerial content;\n\n(b) The content of each presentation shall be well organized and presented in a sequential manner;\n\n(c) There shall be a provision for individual participant course or program registration including information required for record keeping and reporting; and\n\n(d) Self-directed learning activities shall include a written test or evidence of participation.\n\nSource. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10087, eff 3-1-12; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14086, eff 11-24-24",
